## 🧾 **Developer Reference Guide – DocVoice 1.1B (Excel)**

*(This is the internal firmware–BLE interface document for the DocVoice Devboard.)*
It’s designed for **mobile app developers and firmware engineers** to integrate with the board via **Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE)**.

---

