| **Sheet Name**                         | **Purpose / Content Summary**                                                                                                                                                                                                |
| -------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **1️⃣ App Dev Guide**                  | Defines **state machine flow** and **command sequences** to move the device between functional states (Idle → Measuring → Transmitting). Lists all command bytes to send over BLE and expected responses.                    |
